# isoloom targets
✗ esxi (machine `web` asks for a virtual TPM (`vm.tpm: true`), which this target doesn't give (Vagrant on VirtualBox, libvirt or Hyper-V, Proxmox and the big clouds do))

# isoloom generate --target esxi (exit 1)
